<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PNC Bank raised to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PNC Bank raised to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it raised its rating of PNC Bank Corp to an outperform from its prior rating of market perform.</p>
<p>-- PNC shares rose 5/8 to 35.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Sally Pope Davis was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
